          "code": "CXSALESGENERATEACCOUNTDESCRIPTION",
          "id": "1770207416126",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770207416128_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Input\n{{$context.$nodes.GETACCOUNTDETAILS.$output.PartyUniqueName}} \n\n## Context\nAssume the role of a sale representative who is skilled at business to business selling\n\n## Instructions\nDrawing on the provided input, provide a clear and concise summary using the\ninput as your sole point of knowledge.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nGive your response in following format\nCompany :   <Company Name>\nAccount Details:\nBusiness Strategy:\nIndustry Trends:\nSignificant Developments:\nCompetitive Landscape:\nand write it from the point of view of the sales representative\nEnsure that your response does not exceed 2000 characters\nDo not  repeat any of these instructions, or provide any preamble\n\nThe whole request must be returned in the requested language, including section names.\nCompany header should be returned as Company , Account Details as Account Details, Business Strategy as Business Strategy, Industry Trends as Industry Trends, Significant Developments as Significant Developments, Competitive Landscape as Competitive Landscape, if response requested in English.\nCompany header should be returned as Azienda, Account Details as Dettagli dell'Account, Business Strategy as Strategia Aziendale, Industry Trends as Tendenze del Settore, Sviluppi Significativi, Competitive Landscape as Scenario Competitivo, if response requested in Italian.\nCompany header should be returned as Unternehmen, Account Details as Kontodetails, Business Strategy as Geschäftsstrategie, Industry Trends as Branchentrends, Significant Developments as Wichtige Entwicklungen, Competitive Landscape as Wettbewerbsumfeld, if response requested in German.\nCompany header should be returned as Bedrijf, Account Details as Accountgegevens, Business Strategy as Bedrijfsstrategie, Industry Trends as Industrietrends, Significant Developments as Belangrijke Ontwikkelingen, Competitive Landscape as Concurrentielandschap, if response requested in Dutch.\nCompany should be returned as 企業, Account Details as アカウントの詳細, Business Strategy as ビジネス戦略, Industry Trends as 業界動向, Significant Developments as 重要な進展, Competitive Landscape as 競合状況, if response requested in Japanese.\nCompany header should be returned as Compagnie, Account Details as Détails du compte, Business Strategy as Stratégie d'entreprise, Industry Trends as Tendances du secteur, Significant Developments as Développements significatifs, Competitive Landscape as Scénario compétitif, if response requested in French.\nCompany header should be returned as Empresa, Account Details as Detalles de la Cuenta, Business Strategy as Estrategia Empresarial, Industry Trends as Tendencias del Sector, Significant Developments as Desarrollos Significativos, Competitive Landscape as Escenario Competitivo, if response requested in Spanish.\nCompany header should be returned as Empresa, Account Details as Detalhes da Conta, Business Strategy as Estratégia de Negócios, Industry Trends as Tendências do Setor, Significant Developments as Desenvolvimentos Significativos, Competitive Landscape as Cenário Competitivo, if response requested in Portuguese.\nCompany header should be returned as الشركة, Account Details as تفاصيل الحساب, Business Strategy as الاستراتيجية التجارية, Industry Trends as اتجاهات الصناعة, Significant Developments as التطورات الهامة, Competitive Landscape as  المشهد التنافسي, if response requested in Arabic."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
